@WMS.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5276
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

GET {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# ===================================
# RENTAL REQUESTS API TESTS
# ===================================

### 1. Create Rental Request (Renter)
POST {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/rental-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "requestedArea": 100.0,
  "startDate": "2026-04-01T00:00:00",
  "durationMonths": 6,
  "notes": "Need storage for inventory"
}

###

### 2. Get Rental Request by ID
GET {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/rental-requests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Get My Rental Requests (Renter)
GET {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/rental-requests/my-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get Pending Requests (Owner)
GET {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/rental-requests/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Approve Rental Request (Owner)
POST {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/rental-requests/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "requestId": 1,
  "monthlyPayment": 5000000,
  "depositAmount": 5000000,
  "terms": "Standard rental terms apply"
}

###

### 6. Reject Rental Request (Owner)
POST {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/rental-requests/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "requestId": 1,
  "rejectionReason": "Insufficient insurance coverage"
}

###

# ===================================
# RENTAL CONTRACTS API TESTS
# ===================================

### 7. Get Rental Contract by ID
GET {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/rental-contracts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Get My Rental Contracts
GET {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/rental-contracts/my-contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
